#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:7
msgid "Learning Phases and Feature Formation · Phenomenon reproduction"
msgstr "学习阶段与特征形成 · 现象复现"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:10
msgid "Staggered Singular-Value Dynamics"
msgstr "错峰奇异值学习动态"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:13
msgid ""
"A small deep linear network learns the strongest modes of a linear "
"mapping before weaker modes, making effective rank grow in stages."
msgstr "一个小型 deep linear network 会先学习线性映射中较强的模态，再学习较弱的模态，因此有效秩会分阶段增长。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:22
msgid "QQ"
msgstr "清宇"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:27
msgid "Author"
msgstr "作者"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:35
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:37
msgid "**Phenomenon reproduction**"
msgstr "**现象复现**"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:39
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:42
msgid ""
"This graph makes the sequential mode-learning dynamics of deep linear "
"networks inspectable. It is a qualitative reproduction of the mechanism "
"analyzed by Saxe, McClelland, and Ganguli."
msgstr "该图让 deep linear network 中按顺序学习模态的动态过程可供查看。这是对 Saxe、McClelland 和 Ganguli 所分析机制的定性复现。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:47
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [Exact Solutions to the Nonlinear Dynamics of Learning in Deep"
" Linear Neural Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6120), Saxe, "
"McClelland, and Ganguli (ICLR 2014)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [Exact Solutions to the Nonlinear Dynamics of Learning in Deep"
" Linear Neural Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6120)，Saxe、"
"McClelland 和 Ganguli（ICLR 2014）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:49
msgid "**Template:** `staggered sv dynamics`"
msgstr "**模板：** `staggered sv dynamics`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:51
msgid "**Template ID:** `a04f21b3-e31c-4ba3-b8b9-d3af752f77d4`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `a04f21b3-e31c-4ba3-b8b9-d3af752f77d4`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:53
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:55
msgid ""
"The effective map of a deep linear model is the product of its layer "
"matrices. With a small orthogonal initialization, directions with larger "
"target singular values should emerge first. The graph records leading "
"singular values of the effective map so their staggered rises can be "
"compared directly."
msgstr "deep linear model 的有效映射由各层矩阵相乘得到。采用较小尺度的正交初始化时，对应较大目标奇异值的方向应更早显现。该图记录有效映射的前几个奇异值，以便直接比较它们错峰上升的过程。"

