msgstr "已学习权重矩阵乘积的前几个奇异值"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:71
msgid "Run in Comfy Research"
msgstr "在 Comfy Research 中运行"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:73
msgid "Open **Templates** and load `staggered sv dynamics`."
msgstr "打开 **Templates** 并加载 `staggered sv dynamics`。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:74
