msgstr "结合训练损失和 checkpoint 查看前几个奇异值。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:77
msgid ""
"Loaded Staggered Singular-Value Dynamics template with the linear "
"dataset, deep linear MLP, Saxe initialization, Trainer, and weight-"
"product singular-value observable."
msgstr ""
"已加载 Staggered Singular-Value Dynamics 模板，其中包括线性数据集、deep linear MLP、Saxe 初始化、Trainer "
"以及权重乘积奇异值 observable。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:82
msgid "Results and Interpretation"
msgstr "结果与解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:84
msgid ""
"The expected trajectory is staged: the leading singular value rises and "
"levels off before later values make their main transition. This is a "
"finite-step, finite-data signature of mode-wise learning, not evidence "
"that every network learns features one at a time."
msgstr "预期轨迹具有阶段性：最大的奇异值先上升并趋于平稳，随后其他奇异值才进入主要变化阶段。这是在有限步数和有限数据下逐模态学习的特征，并不意味着所有网络都会逐一学习特征。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:89
msgid ""
"Weight product singular-value visualization from the completed staggered "
"dynamics run, showing four modes emerging at different times."
msgstr "完成错峰动态运行后的权重乘积奇异值可视化，展示四个模态在不同时间显现。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:94
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:96
msgid "The theory is for deep linear models; nonlinear models can couple modes."
msgstr "该理论针对 deep linear model；非线性模型可能会耦合不同模态。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:97
msgid "Mini-batch noise and a finite learning rate can blur the stages."
msgstr "mini-batch 噪声和有限的学习率可能会模糊这些阶段。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/staggered-singular-value-dynamics.md:98
msgid "Only the leading part of the spectrum is visualized."
msgstr "仅展示频谱的前段部分。"
